<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar committee sets periodic sugar refunds.</title>
<headline>EU sugar committee sets periodic sugar refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday set periodic refunds for white and raw sugar in its natural state, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The refund for white sugar in its natural state was set at 43.58 Ecus per 100 kg and for raw sugar at 38.92 Ecus per 100 kg.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
